			"notes": "vincent's boosted dyes are hidden now until you open them yourself.\n\nevery skyblock year vincent picks three dyes and boosts their drop rates, two at 2x and one at 3x, and his menu shows you which three the second you walk up to it. this puts question marks over them instead. click one and you get a csgo style case opening that scrolls dyes past and lands on the one actually boosted in that slot.\n\nthe dyes on the reel are the real ones. the mod learns their icons from any menu with dyes in it, vincent's dye compendium being the quickest, and remembers them between sessions. open the compendium once and the reel fills out to all 67.\n\nthe year is read off the dyes themselves so none of this needs a clock. they hide again on their own when the rotation turns over, and since reveals are remembered by name, a mid year swap only re-hides the dye that actually changed.\n\nnothing goes to the server. the click on a question mark is swallowed by the mod and the items in the menu are left alone, so hypixel and every other mod still see exactly what vincent sent.\n\nthere is a new vincent category in the config with a toggle and an animation length slider. open the menu with /dyes.\n\nthe animation is ported from skyocean, used under its mit licence."
